<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - American Stores started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - American Stores started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it initiated coverage of American Stores Co and added it to the recommended list.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- American Stores added 1-1/2 to 48-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Separately, on Tuesday, American Stores set a two-for-one stock split, payable July 16, 1997 to shareholders of record on July 1, 1997.</p>
</text>
